# The shared TextField with a physical keyboard (docs/dev/clipboard.md, P1): the selection (Shift+arrows, Home, End,
# Ctrl+A), Ctrl+C / X / V and the Insert / Delete equivalents on the launcher's clipboard (the real launcher.sock protocol
# on the other end: `clipboard server on`), typing and Backspace over a selection, Esc ending it. The field "Name" holds
# "café €5 and more" (16 characters, bytes 2 and 3 wide among them): a byte offset that is not a character boundary would
# show here as a broken text. The selection colour is checked on the drawn field (expect_selection). Review only.
title text field: selection and clipboard keys
review
sizes 800x480 640x480 480x320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
clipboard server on
fielddemo
wait 300
shot clip_start
expect_caret Name 16
expect_selection Name none
# Shift+Left x3: the last three characters
key SHIFT+LEFT
key SHIFT+LEFT
key SHIFT+LEFT
expect_selection Name 13 16
shot clip_shift_left
# Ctrl+C copies the selection
key CTRL+C
clipboard expect "ore"
# Shift+Home extends to the start (the anchor stays at the end); Left collapses to the start
key SHIFT+HOME
expect_selection Name 0 16
shot clip_shift_home
key LEFT
expect_caret Name 0
expect_selection Name none
# Ctrl+V at the start
key CTRL+V
expect_field Name "orecafé €5 and more"
expect_caret Name 3
# Shift+Right x2 selects "ca"; Backspace deletes just the selection
key SHIFT+RIGHT
key SHIFT+RIGHT
expect_selection Name 3 5
key BACKSPACE
expect_field Name "orefé €5 and more"
expect_caret Name 3
expect_selection Name none
# Ctrl+A selects all, Ctrl+X cuts (the clipboard has it first), Ctrl+V brings it back
key CTRL+A
expect_selection Name 0 17
shot clip_select_all
key CTRL+X
clipboard expect "orefé €5 and more"
expect_field Name ""
expect_selection Name none
key CTRL+V
expect_field Name "orefé €5 and more"
expect_caret Name 17
# typing over a selection replaces it
key CTRL+A
type z
expect_field Name "z"
# Delete with a selection deletes just the selection
key CTRL+V
expect_field Name "zorefé €5 and more"
key SHIFT+HOME
key DELETE
expect_field Name ""
# Shift+Insert pastes, Ctrl+Insert copies, Shift+Delete cuts
clipboard set viaInsert
key SHIFT+INSERT
expect_field Name "viaInsert"
clipboard set other
key CTRL+A
key CTRL+INSERT
clipboard expect viaInsert
clipboard set other
key SHIFT+DELETE
clipboard expect viaInsert
expect_field Name ""
# nothing selected: Ctrl+C copies the whole field, Ctrl+X does nothing
key SHIFT+INSERT
expect_field Name "viaInsert"
key END
clipboard set zzz
key CTRL+C
clipboard expect viaInsert
clipboard set zzz
key CTRL+X
clipboard expect zzz
expect_field Name "viaInsert"
# Esc ends the editing and the selection with it
key CTRL+A
expect_selection Name 0 9
key ESC
expect_selection Name none
shot clip_after_esc
